--- a dump changes no file of the data path ---
tables dumped: 6
data path unchanged by the dump
--- an object that was not dropped completely is refused ---
dump rc=48, refused: 1
data path unchanged by the refused dump
--- a database without its metadata file is refused ---
dump rc=48, refused: 1
data path unchanged by the refused dump
--- an object is created after the dictionary its predictXGBoost call reads ---
xgboost: dump rc=0
SET enable_xgboost = 1;
xgboost: replay rc=0
--- the declarations of a table-function structure keep their gates ---
structure_statistics: dump rc=0
SET allow_statistics = 1;
structure_statistics: replay rc=0
structure_codec: dump rc=0
SET enable_zxc_codec = 1;
structure_codec: replay rc=0
